{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10571","headline":"燕衔泥 · 冯着","name":"燕衔泥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双燕碌碌飞入屋，屋中老人喜燕归。\n裴回绕我牀头飞，去年爲尔逐黄雀。\n雨多屋漏泥土落，尔莫厌老翁茅屋低，梁头作窠梁下栖。\n尔不见东家黄鷇鸣啧啧，蛇盘瓦沟鼠穿壁。\n豪家大屋尔莫居，娇儿少妇采尔雏。\n井旁写水泥自足，衔泥上屋随尔欲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯着","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}